/* PHONE SCALE (PD UI, touch M2; html.touch-phone, set by src/hud/touch.js): at a phone's 390 px the page's --s was
   0.54 and its words 6 px. It is sized to the width instead (1170 units across: the page with 20-unit margins), and
   scrolls up and down; Resume is pinned top right, where a thumb finds it, without its Esc keycap. */
/* (no backdrop blur under touch: a filtered #menu holds its fixed children, so Resume scrolled away; and it is a
   phone's cost for little, the darker veil does its work) */
